Chapter: Sensors

 The Sensors effect provides accelerometer, gyroscope, barometer, and light-level.
 To accelerometer gives a three-axis reading as nested Pairs of Integers.
 To gyroscope gives a three-axis rotation reading as nested Pairs of Integers.
 To barometer gives the atmospheric pressure as an Integer.
 To light-level gives the ambient light level as an Integer.

 We say:

Section: Definitions

  effect Sensors where
    accelerometer : [Sensors] Pair Integer (Pair Integer Integer)
    gyroscope     : [Sensors] Pair Integer (Pair Integer Integer)
    barometer     : [Sensors] Integer
    light-level   : [Sensors] Integer

